OL,3,GNEWSANew fire-hit mansion development
OL,4,Aplans submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FRevised plans for the development of a
OL,7,Ffire-hit Grade I listed mansion have
OL,8,Fbeen submitted following local
OL,9,Fopposition.
OL,11,FDorset Council has received a planning
OL,12,Fapplication for Parnham Park in
OL,13,FBeaminster, which was partially
OL,14,Fdestroyed by fire in 2017.
OL,16,FIt proposes Parnham House would become
OL,17,Fa private home and hospitality venue,
OL,18,Fwith Pump Cottage providing guest
OL,19,Faccommodation, along with 71 new homes,
OL,20,Freduced from 82.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
