OL,3,GNEWSANew fire-hit mansion development
OL,4,Aplans submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Natural Heritage Initiative,
OL,7,Fwhich opposes the plans, said
OL,8,F"residents' concerns around the
OL,9,Fhospitality business case and funding
OL,10,Ffor the project remain".
